<title>PORTUGAL: Cerexport, Vista Alegre halted in Lisbon.</title>
<headline>Cerexport, Vista Alegre halted in Lisbon.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share trade in ceramic groups Cerexport-Ceramica de Exportacao and Fabrica de Porcelana Vista Alegre was suspended by Portugal's Financial Markets Committee on Wednesday, a spokesman for the Lisbon bourse said.</p>
<p>The spokesman gave no reason but there has been press speculation of a merger between the two groups.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bourse 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
